Description: offline evidence analysis and incident reporting drafts
 Investigate supported evidence formats with exact byte provenance,
 explicit time uncertainty, conditional claims and reproducible analysis.
 A terminal workbench exposes evidence, controls, draft reporting timelines,
 signed evidence packets and revision-bound reviews without a server.
 .
 This development preview does not establish factual truth, completeness,
 legal compliance or independent legal review. Local case data is plaintext.
